+ * 0.1.5-rc.x mount: a `settings` service owning the raw document, the
+ * per-namespace revision counter and the `settings/updated` commit event,
+ * whose `register(ns, schema, options)` resolves the stored section through
+ * the schema and the Adapter's cross-field validator and returns the owner
+ * scope. 0.1.7-rc.1 stopped publishing the provider class (a plugin's own
+ * profile-entry Config replaced it), so the legacy branch is covered against
+ * this double instead of an installed provider, the same way the client tests
+ * cover the legacy write faces with generation fakes.
